{'symbol': 'NVDA', 'date': '2021-08-18 16:20:00', 'title': 'NVIDIA ANNOUNCES FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR SECOND QUARTER FISCAL 2022', 'text': "SANTA CLARA, CALIF., AUG. 18, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NVIDIA (NASDAQ: NVDA) TODAY REPORTED RECORD REVENUE FOR THE SECOND QUARTER ENDED AUGUST 1, 2021, OF $6.51 BILLION, UP 68 PERCENT FROM A YEAR EARLIER AND UP 15 PERCENT FROM THE PREVIOUS QUARTER, WITH RECORD REVENUE FROM THE COMPANY'S GAMING, DATA CENTER AND PROFESSIONAL VISUALIZATION PLATFORMS."}